name plautopatch
category Package
revision 64072
shortdesc Automated patches for pLaTeX/upLaTeX
longdesc Japanese pLaTeX/upLaTeX formats and packages often conflict
longdesc with other LaTeX packages which are unaware of pLaTeX/upLaTeX.
longdesc In the worst case, such packages throw a fatal error or end up
longdesc with a wrong output. The goal of this package is that there
longdesc should be no need to worry about such incompatibilities,
longdesc because specific patches are loaded automatically whenever
longdesc necessary. This helps not only to simplify source files, but
longdesc also to make the appearance of working pLaTeX/upLaTeX sources
longdesc similar to those of ordinary LaTeX ones.
